                        "en": "Nobody asked but: this level is based on SansGrinder's LOD 30",
                        "zh": "0个人问了：这关是衫竹的彩陶030改的"
                    },
                    {
                        "en": "Some (2) plants are slightly modified to remove the RNG factors in this level. Trust your instincts!",
